LIGHTNING RELEASE (RAITON) — TECHNIQUE REFERENCE
Konohagakure Jutsu Archive — Chunin+ access

Lightning Release molds chakra into electricity, prized for piercing
power and speed. Strong against earth, weak against wind.

Selected Techniques:
- Chidori (A-rank): Concentrated lightning in the hand for a piercing
  thrust; the user's signature assassination technique. Devised by
  Kakashi Hatake, who taught it to Sasuke Uchiha. Requires the Sharingan
  or exceptional reflexes to use safely due to tunnel vision at speed.
- Lightning Cutter (Raikiri): a refined, higher-output Chidori; named
  for cutting through a bolt of lightning.
- Lightning Release: Purple Electricity — a stream of high-voltage
  discharge (advanced).

Safety Note: Chidori's straight-line charge leaves the user exposed. It
is not for undisciplined genin. Practice chakra shape and nature control
under a qualified Jonin. Limited daily uses due to chakra cost.
